    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/cf547229824722623640041854c7ee1d.poster.avif?t=1754925884\" width=800 height=75 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/cf547229824722623640041854c7ee1d.webm?t=1754925884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience deckbuilding without energy or action points</strong>\u00a0\u2013 play your cards using physical space. There's no limit to how many cards you can play, as long as they fit! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/4ea2a0d47ab01b0bd05f44874ba97a1b.poster.avif?t=1754925884\" width=800 height=387 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/4ea2a0d47ab01b0bd05f44874ba97a1b.webm?t=1754925884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/72ab1c979d3638491c2633a9dafc7ec9.poster.avif?t=1754925884\" width=800 height=81 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/72ab1c979d3638491c2633a9dafc7ec9.webm?t=1754925884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>three playable characters</strong> and <strong>hundreds of cards</strong> to choose from, there are countless possible decks with a variety of strategies and play styles.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/3c7176ee1d9293bfa9954c09c9d2688c.poster.avif?t=1754925884\" width=800 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/3c7176ee1d9293bfa9954c09c9d2688c.webm?t=1754925884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/67a2ad03d2f215cf5f68b0aa898e5b3a.poster.avif?t=1754925884\" width=800 height=75 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/67a2ad03d2f215cf5f68b0aa898e5b3a.webm?t=1754925884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Position your cards strategically</strong> and get massive bonuses for adjacency, overlap, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/56b2121a31235cbc8bb7a7598c3f2e6d.poster.avif?t=1754925884\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/56b2121a31235cbc8bb7a7598c3f2e6d.webm?t=1754925884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/dc58fbc45663c9512b473c4b57929a21.poster.avif?t=1754925884\" width=800 height=79 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/dc58fbc45663c9512b473c4b57929a21.webm?t=1754925884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reshape your cards</strong> and inscribe them with <strong>runes of power</strong>. Spread the benefits over your entire deck, or put everything into one or two overpowered cards.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/d9c09385347d53b206a430d9faa10fba.poster.avif?t=1754925884\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/d9c09385347d53b206a430d9faa10fba.webm?t=1754925884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/a0c8ad461938b5e28ebb758835fd9dbf.poster.avif?t=1754925884\" width=800 height=79 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/a0c8ad461938b5e28ebb758835fd9dbf.webm?t=1754925884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some cards persist on your board</strong> between turns or have <strong>ongoing effects. </strong>Certain enemies will even place their own <strong>hostile cards\u00a0</strong>onto your board!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/f120e232d642f09fc5e37e62c0fb4c05.poster.avif?t=1754925884\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/f120e232d642f09fc5e37e62c0fb4c05.webm?t=1754925884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Discord to sign up for a playtest! </strong>We'd love to hear your feedback!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/cf547229824722623640041854c7ee1d.poster.avif?t=1754925884\" width=800 height=75 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/cf547229824722623640041854c7ee1d.webm?t=1754925884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Experience deckbuilding without energy or action points</strong>\u00a0\u2013 play your cards using physical space. There's no limit to how many cards you can play, as long as they fit! </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/4ea2a0d47ab01b0bd05f44874ba97a1b.poster.avif?t=1754925884\" width=800 height=387 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/4ea2a0d47ab01b0bd05f44874ba97a1b.webm?t=1754925884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/72ab1c979d3638491c2633a9dafc7ec9.poster.avif?t=1754925884\" width=800 height=81 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/72ab1c979d3638491c2633a9dafc7ec9.webm?t=1754925884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>three playable characters</strong> and <strong>hundreds of cards</strong> to choose from, there are countless possible decks with a variety of strategies and pla