1.poster.avif?t=1754925884\" width=800 height=79 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/dc58fbc45663c9512b473c4b57929a21.webm?t=1754925884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reshape your cards</strong> and inscribe them with <strong>runes of power</strong>. Spread the benefits over your entire deck, or put everything into one or two overpowered cards.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/d9c09385347d53b206a430d9faa10fba.poster.avif?t=1754925884\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/d9c09385347d53b206a430d9faa10fba.webm?t=1754925884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/a0c8ad461938b5e28ebb758835fd9dbf.poster.avif?t=1754925884\" width=800 height=79 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/a0c8ad461938b5e28ebb758835fd9dbf.webm?t=1754925884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some cards persist on your board</strong> between turns or have <strong>ongoing effects. </strong>Certain enemies will even place their own <strong>hostile cards\u00a0</strong>onto your board!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/f120e232d642f09fc5e37e62c0fb4c05.poster.avif?t=1754925884\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3284290/extras/f120e232d642f09fc5e37e62c0fb4c05.webm?t=1754925884\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Join our Discord to sign up for a playtest! </strong>We'd love to hear your feedback!</p>",
